SUMMARY:AMA-MSS Advocacy in Action Workshop (Night 1)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:Virtual\, 8–9:30 PM Eastern (7–8:30 PM Central). Three-nigh
 t virtual advocacy workshop combining the former Physicians of the Future 
 Summit with Advocacy in Action. Keynote speakers are former AMA MSS\, RFS\
 , and/or YPS members\, several now in state and federal office\; programmi
 ng includes issue briefs on GME reform\, the Patients First Act (Medicare 
 reform)\, and maternal health access. Participants receive a folder of adv
 ocacy materials with templates\, social media graphics\, and the issue bri
 efs.\nHost: AMA-MSS\nRSVP requested: https://www.ama-assn.org/membership/e
 vents/advocacy-action-workshop\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.
 github.io/bcm-events/event/115.html
URL:https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/115.html
CATEGORIES:Student org
